{"resourceIdentifier":"3897","resourceName":"Mangrove restoration project in Wenchang and Changjiang, Hainan","description":"Mangrove restoration project in Wenchang and Changjiang, Hainan (hereafter as “the project”) is located in coastal areas of Dongge town, Wenjiao Town, Dongjiao Town, Wencheng Town, Puqian town and Jinshan Town of Wenchang city in the Northest Hainan Island, and Zhubijiang estuary of Changjiang Li Autonomous County in the west Hainan Island.\r\nThe project is aimed to increase carbon sequestration and contribute to local sustainable development by planting trees on degraded mangrove ecosystem. 352.89 ha of mangrove is to be restored by plantation of mangrove seedlings on intertidal areas where mangroves had been lost in past decades in Wenchang city and Zhubijiang estuary of Changjiang Li Autonomous County which located in Hainan Province.\r\nThe project has expanded the mangrove area and improved the quality of mangroves through the artificial afforestation of mangroves on the beach, which will effectively protect the mangrove ecosystem, save and protect the mangrove germplasm resources and rare and endangered wildlife resources. At the same time, the implementation of the project will also improve the ecological functions of mangroves in wind and wave prevention, siltation and beach protection, bank consolidation and embankment protection, disaster prevention and mitigation, and ensure the safety of people's lives and property.","location":{"latitude":19.494730,"longitude":108.937708},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-02-07","endExclusive":"2023-03-10","endInclusive":"2023-03-09"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3897"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hainan"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS